  "notes": "Blade Ball is a PvP dodgeball game from Wiggity where a glowing ball locks onto one player at a time and flies at them faster with every hit. You press block (F, left click or the on-screen button) at the right moment to send it at someone else, and the last player left standing wins the round. Wins earn coins, and you can equip abilities like Dash or Super Jump plus sword skins and finishing effects.\n\nMost Blade Ball codes give a free spin on the current wheel, with the odd sword skin, luck boost or ticket for a limited game mode mixed in. Spins are the most useful reward because each one is a chance at a rare sword or explosion effect without paying. New codes usually show up with big updates, seasonal events and visit milestones like 2B and 4B visits, and they get posted on the @Blade_Ball X account and in the Discord.",
